<title>FRANCE: EU sells German intervention barley, rye.</title>
<headline>EU sells German intervention barley, rye.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday sold 38,273 tonnes of German intervention barley for export to non-EU countries at a minimum price of 103.58 Ecus per tonne, grain traders said.</p>
<p>The EU's grain panel also sold 4,092 tonnes of German intervention rye at a minimum price of 101.96 Ecus per tonne, they said. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
